From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jay Leaton <58495321+jayleaton@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 22:33:56 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 43/44] qwen27: copy drafts on by default on Metal, opt-in for
 EXL3

Without a drafter, copies now default on unless the checkpoint is EXL3, whose verify
windows change its summation order (TF_QWEN27_COPIES=1 still turns them on).
--no-drafts turns copies off in lone and shared rounds, and the host decides the
policy once for the backend.

M5 Ultra, q4, served greedy chat at 1, 2 and 4 streams: 12/12 replies equal
--no-drafts; repeat 60 -> 344 tok/s, code edit 85, prose 92, story unchanged.
